# The <2x2x2:7> level's right program (DPS's dyadic accurate point, see dps7_L.slp): 4 blocks of B
# -> 7 right factors; i0 = B11, i1 = B12, i2 = B21, i3 = B22.  Cancellation-free, 8 additions and
# 3 scalings by powers of two.
t1:=i0-i3;
t2:=i1/4;
t3:=i2-t2;
t4:=i1/2;
t5:=t1/2;
t6:=i0+t4;
t7:=t4-i3;
t8:=t5-t3;
t9:=i3+t4;
t10:=i0-t4;
t11:=t3+t5;
o0:=t1;
o1:=t6;
o2:=t7;
o3:=t8;
o4:=t9;
o5:=t10;
o6:=t11;
